# Vendored browser libraries are pinned by tests/vendor-assets.test.cjs on byte size and
# SHA-256, so they must stay byte-identical in every checkout. Without this rule,
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF on Windows and the pin fails as a false alarm.
assets/vendor/*.js -text

# Self-hosted raster art (tests/local-image-assets.test.cjs budgets its total weight).
# Never line-ending converted, never diffed as text.
assets/img/*.png binary
assets/img/*.webp binary

# Self-hosted brand fonts (tests/csp-fontsource.test.cjs checks the wOF2 magic bytes and the
# total weight). Line-ending conversion would corrupt these and they are meaningless as diffs.
assets/fonts/files/*.woff2 binary

# Product icons (tests/app-icon.test.cjs parses both ICO containers): build/icon.ico must keep the
# installer's 16-256 ladder, favicon.ico stops at 48 because a browser fetches it unprompted. An EOL
# rewrite would corrupt either, and both are meaningless as text diffs.
*.ico binary
